<h2>Number Talk</h2>
<p><strong>Original 2021 learning goal:</strong> Apply understanding of addition and subtraction within 1,000 to create a Number Talk activity.</p>
<p>Warm-up Number Talk: Addition (10 minutes). Mental products are not involved. Compute 300 + 400 = 700, 300 + 437 = 737, 321 + 437 = 758, and 425 + 514 = 939, using place value and connections between nearby expressions.</p>
<h3>Number Talk Design 1</h3><p>Give at least two mental strategies for 600−400, 600−399 and 500−399; invent one fourth related subtraction. Teacher evaluates actual cards, drawings, images, and oral work where required.</p>
<h3>Number Talk Design 2</h3><p>Use 500+199 and 504+199, explain strategies and invent two additional related addition expressions. Teacher evaluates actual cards, drawings, images, and oral work where required.</p>
<h3>Number Talk Design 3</h3><p>Extend 900−400 with three additional subtraction expressions connected by a mental method. Teacher evaluates actual cards, drawings, images, and oral work where required.</p>
<h3>Number Talk Design 4</h3><p>Create four addition/subtraction expressions and explain a meaningful Number Talk progression. Teacher evaluates actual cards, drawings, images, and oral work where required.</p>
